Z||000000||ArchMagi||07-20-2000||03:50 PM||||I was down at my local car delership and i saw a 87 Fiero SE.  He wanted 2995$ for it, he then procceed to tell me i just missed a sale on it, which was set at 1995$.  From the brief look of it, there was a small crack in the paint on the bumper, thats all i noticed.  Now, is 2995$ a fair price? What should i offer him?   <P>Thanks Alot!||||reg||10
Z||000001||My7Fieros||07-20-2000||03:56 PM||||How many miles are on it? What condition mechanically is it in? What about the interior?<BR>Those guys are full of s&%t when they give you that "oh you just missed the sale, it was a thousand dollars off"...yeah right.<BR>Tell him since it didnt sell then, youll start with the sale price.......||||reg||1
